License: PSF-2.0
 The full text of the Python Software Foundation License Version 2 is in
 /opt/segl/python/lib/python3.*/LICENSE.txt.

License: ISC
 The full text, with each package's copyright notice, is in that package's
 folder under /usr/share/doc/segl/web-licenses/.

License: 0BSD
 The full text, with its copyright notice, is in the tslib folder under
 /usr/share/doc/segl/web-licenses/.

License: Zlib
 The full text, with its copyright notice, is in the pako folder under
 /usr/share/doc/segl/web-licenses/.

License: CC0-1.0
 On Debian systems, the full text of the CC0 1.0 Universal dedication is in
 /usr/share/common-licenses/CC0-1.0. The package also carries it in the
 fractional-indexing folder under /usr/share/doc/segl/web-licenses/.

License: OFL-1.1
 The full text of the SIL Open Font License 1.1 is in each such font's
 folder under /usr/share/doc/segl/font-licenses/.
